      "language": "english",
      "review": "Love this game. It took me a while to get the hang of it. There is so much to learn it was a bit overwhelming but the more I understood the game the better it got. Space exploration aside the game has so much more, base building, Creature battles, custom ships and even a simple music maker and so much more. This game is filled with things to do. I look forward to seeing more updates for this game in the future.",
