      "language": "english",
      "review": "Hats off to Hello Games for the effort that has been put into this game after its initial launch. I think the game is impressive in many ways with clever procedural implementation married with multiplayer accessibility and nice visuals and sound, There is evidently hours of content to be explored, I just can't quite get into the game ... has a hollow feel to it somehow and I want to feel the wonder of this vast space but it doesn't quite hit the mark, To much fetchie fetchie! Resource farming for me.  I think the procedural framework is not something that works for everyone, I think I just wanted something with a bit more on the bone ... Try it in a sale by all means as I think this will scratch an itch for a lot of people",
